          "name_loc": "Holy Persuasion",
          "desc_loc": "Chen takes control of an enemy or neutral creep and receives a percentage of its bounty. Chen may globally target his own creep if it has not taken damage in the last %unsummon_time% seconds to unsummon it.<br><br>Casting Holy Persuasion on Chen teleports all creeps under his control to him after a delay. Taking damage from enemy heroes or their units cancels the teleport.",
